Description: client library for the Hugging Face Hub
 huggingface_hub is the official Python client for the Hugging Face Hub. It
 allows downloading and publishing models, datasets, and Spaces, managing
 repositories, and interacting with the Hub's API from Python code or the
 command line.
 .
 This package is built without the optional hf-xet accelerator (a Rust/PyO3
 extension not available in Debian). huggingface_hub transparently falls
 back to standard HTTP downloads when hf_xet is not installed.
